{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="page-hero has-img" data-screen-label="Services — hero">
  <div class="ph-bg"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="100vw" src="/images/IMG_6422.jpg" alt="Seaside landscape in Thailand"></div>
  <div class="ph-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>A tailor-made trip to Thailand, from A to Z</h1>
    <p>Complete, personalized trip planning for Thailand and Southeast Asia — with you in control.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns"><a class="btn btn-teal btn-lg" href="#formules"><span>See my packages <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a><p class="hero-price">from <span class="price-chf" data-chf="35">35 CHF</span> / day</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream sv-compare">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2>What changes with me</h2>
      <p>A travel planner is not an agency. Here is what that means for your trip, in practice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cmp-two">
      <div class="cmp-col cmp-ag"><h3>Agency</h3><dl>
          <dt>The trip</dt><dd>A ready-made tour, sold to many clients</dd>
          <dt>Prices</dt><dd>A margin on every hotel, activity and transfer</dd>
          <dt>Contact</dt><dd>An adviser handling many files</dd>
          <dt>On the ground</dt><dd>A support number in Europe</dd>
          <dt>Your bookings</dt><dd>In the agency's name, hard to change</dd>
      </dl></div>
      <div class="cmp-col cmp-me"><h3>With me</h3><dl>
          <dt>The trip</dt><dd>Built with you, from what you want, your pace and your budget</dd>
          <dt>Prices</dt><dd>I compare flights, hotels, activities, transport and restaurants, you pay the direct price</dd>
          <dt>Contact</dt><dd>Calls with me to fine-tune each stage, for as long as it takes</dd>
          <dt>On the ground</dt><dd>Me, in Koh Lanta, on WhatsApp for your whole trip</dd>
          <dt>Your bookings</dt><dd>In your name, you stay in control of each booking</dd>
      </dl></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad sv-carnet">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split reverse">
      <div class="split-media tall">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_3258.jpg" alt="Anaïs under the coconut trees in Thailand">
      </div>
      <div class="split-text">
        <h2>The travel journal</h2>
        <p>Every trip is unique. I create a complete, personalized digital travel journal for you, which becomes your guide before and during your stay.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list mt-m">
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> A day-by-day itinerary with activity suggestions</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Your transport, accommodation and activities all in one place</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> All the links you need to book easily</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Practical and cultural tips, plus my local insider advice</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad sv-scope">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split sv-scope-card">
      <div data-reveal="left">
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.4rem)">What's included</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list mt-m">
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Initial contact + free discovery call</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Itinerary proposals based on your budget and pace</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Selection of suitable accommodation and transport</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Suggestions for local activities and experiences</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Complete digital travel journal + all booking links</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Pre-trip support and WhatsApp assistance 7 days a week during your trip</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal="right">
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.4rem)">What's left up to you</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list mt-m">
          <li><span class="tick tick--no"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Bookings (flights, hotels, activities)</li>
          <li><span class="tick tick--no"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Insurance and visas</li>
          <li><span class="tick tick--no"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> On-the-ground services (guides, drivers)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-m" style="color:var(--ink-mute);font-size:0.96rem">This guarantees you total freedom over your choices — and no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad pricing sv-pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="formules">My <em>travel</em> packages</h2>
      <p>Three packages, flexible to fit your project. Can't find quite what you're looking for? We'll adapt it together.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="formules">
      <div class="formule">
        <h3>Light</h3>
        <p class="aud">Independent travelers</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="35">35 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Tailor-made itinerary</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Selection of local activities &amp; experiences</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Transport selection for each stop</li>
          <li class="no"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg> No accommodation selection</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Personalized advice &amp; local tips</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Complete digital travel journal</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Pre-trip support &amp; WhatsApp assistance 7 days a week</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get a quote</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="formule featured">
        <span class="badge">Most popular</span>
        <h3>Solo / Duo</h3>
        <p class="aud">Up to 2 people</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="40">40 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Tailor-made itinerary for up to 3 cities</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Selection of local activities &amp; experiences</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Transport &amp; accommodation selection (2-4 options per stop)</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Personalized advice &amp; local tips</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Complete digital travel journal</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Pre-trip support &amp; WhatsApp assistance 7 days a week</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-white" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get a quote</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="formule">
        <h3>Family</h3>
        <p class="aud">Up to 4 people</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="43">43 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Everything included in Solo / Duo</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Activities suited to children of all ages</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Itinerary designed for family travel</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Up to 4 people (extra fee beyond that)</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get a quote</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="formule-region" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="aud">Per-region package</p>
        <h3>Recommended for trips of two weeks or more</h3>
        <p>The same information as the per-day packages, accommodation, activities and good addresses, sorted by region rather than day by day. No fixed programme in the journal, you organise your days as you like. One price per region visited.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="formule-region-price">
        <div class="price">from <span class="price-chf" data-chf="120">120 CHF</span> <small>/ region</small></div>
        <a class="btn btn-white" href="/en/contact/"><span>Request a quote</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-center mt-l" data-reveal style="color:var(--ink-mute);font-size:0.95rem">Real example: 2 weeks as a couple = <span class="price-chf" data-chf="560">560 CHF</span> total, or about ~<span class="price-chf" data-chf="20">20 CHF</span> per person per day — often offset by the savings you make on the ground. Is your itinerary more than 3 cities? No problem, we'll adapt the quote together.</p>
    <span class="currency-note" hidden>Indicative rate, updated daily — CHF remains the reference currency.</span>
    <div class="offer-panel sv-offer" id="appel-conseil">
      <div class="split">
      <div class="split-media sv-offer-photo">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 40vw, 100vw" src="/images/appel-conseil.jpg" alt="Anaïs on the phone, notebook open, during a consultation call">
      </div>
      <div class="split-text">
        <h2>Consultation call — <span class="script">1 hour</span></h2>
        <p>Do you like planning your own trip, but want advice from someone who actually lives here, so you can be sure you're making the right choices?</p>
        <p class="mt-s">Book an hour-long video call with me to go over your project, fine-tune your itinerary and answer all your questions. Together, we can go over:</p>
        <ul class="feature-list mt-s">
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Your itinerary and travel pace</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> The regions, islands or cities best suited to your needs</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Transport and logistics between each stop</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Which neighborhoods to stay in and which to avoid</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Must-see activities… as well as more authentic experiences</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Any questions you have before you leave</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-s">By the end of our call, you'll walk away with a clear vision of your trip and all the advice you need to keep planning with total peace of mind.</p>
        <p class="mt-m"><span class="option-flag"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="70">70 CHF</span> · deductible from the full package</span></p>
        <p class="mt-s" style="color:var(--ink-mute);font-size:0.9rem">Available for all of Thailand and Indonesia (Bali, Lombok)</p>
        <a class="btn btn-teal mt-m" href="https://wa.me/66958683846?text=Hi%20Ana%C3%AFs%21%20I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20a%201-hour%20consultation%20call%20for%20my%20trip%20%F0%9F%8C%B4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-magnetic><span>Book my call <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-center mt-l" style="color:var(--ink-mute);font-size:0.97rem">
      Questions about how it works?
      <a class="text-link" href="/en/faq/">Check the FAQ
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad sv-steps">
  <div class="container sv-steps-grid">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>How the process works</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">1</div><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Tell me about the trip you're dreaming of by email, contact form or social media, and ask me all your questions.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">2</div><h3>Travel questionnaire</h3><p>A short questionnaire to understand your project: dates, destinations, activities, budget, travelers and preferences.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">3</div><h3>Discovery call</h3><p>Free and no obligation. We talk through your needs, and I explain my services and packages.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">4</div><h3>Itinerary &amp; quote</h3><p>I put together a first version of your tailor-made itinerary, based on your requests and your budget.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">5</div><h3>Trip design</h3><p>Once the quote is confirmed, I research, compare and put together a selection of the best accommodation and transport options for each stop.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">6</div><h3>Bookings</h3><p>Time to book: using my selection of accommodation and transport, you make your own bookings through the direct links I provide. You stay in control and free to choose.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">7</div><h3>Travel journal</h3><p>You receive your complete travel journal: all your bookings in one place, day-by-day activity suggestions, and all the local info and tips you need to enjoy your trip with total peace of mind.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot">8</div><h3>Off you go!</h3><p>Enjoy, stress-free. Have a question during your trip? I'm available on WhatsApp 7 days a week.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

