      <h2>My other services</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-tiles">
      <div class="tile"><div class="tile-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, 100vw" src="/images/girls/piscine-koh-lanta.jpg" alt=""></div><h3>PDF guides</h3><p>Inspiration and useful info: where to go, what to do, what to try, and which addresses to note down. Pay what you want.</p><a class="text-link mt-s" href="/en/guides/">Discover <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="tile-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, 100vw" src="/images/galerie/bangkok-rooftop.jpg" alt=""></div><h3>Gift cards</h3><p>100% customizable. Give the gift of a complete travel-planning experience, for any occasion.</p><a class="text-link mt-s" href="/en/cartes-cadeaux/">Order now <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

